<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OLD KENT CUT ON PRICE.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OLD KENT CUT ON PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Michael Plodwick  downgraded Old Kent Financial Corp to hold from buy due to the stock's  recent price gains.</p>
<p>-- shares were off one to 63-3/4.</p>
</text>
